# Token Optimization

Estimated workspace tokens: ~2.16M
Potential savings with optimization: ~62%

## Rules
1. Use @-file references for specific paths, not directory globs
2. Summarize architecture in rules instead of re-reading large docs each prompt
3. Exclude generated and dependency folders from every prompt
4. For bugs, paste only relevant log excerpts (max ~50 lines)
5. For UI work, describe layout in words; attach screenshots only when necessary
6. Split large refactors into phased prompts

